y\n13. should add 30 % risk surcharge for highly enchanted items (enchantment level ≥ 5) -- applies to base premium of enchanted item only\n14. should apply cursed surcharge only to cursed sword in multi-item policy -- modifier scope per item\n15. should apply 20 % loyalty discount for long-standing customers (≥ 2 years) -- policy-wide modifier\n16. should apply 10 % initial assessment surcharge for first insurance -- applies per item regardless of customer history\n17. should apply 15 % discount on each contract after first -- policy-wide modifier\n18. should add 5 G processing fee to every premium -- added at the very end\n19. should round final premium to whole G in MHPCO's favor -- e.g. 197.5 → 198\n20. should round final payout to whole G in MHPCO's favor -- e.g. 350.5 → 350\n21. should reject quote with unknown item type and exit with error -- e.g. broomstick\n22. should reject claim with damage to item not in policy and exit with error\n23. should reject claim with negative damage amount and exit with error\n24. should compute payout 400 G for regular sword damage 500 G -- standard reimbursement minus deductible\n25. should compute payout 100 G for rune damage 200 G"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784951651285,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-b70b58f0-76ac-45b4-a51c-62bd679cb421","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}}
