eject claim with damage to item not in policy and exit with error\n23. should reject claim with negative damage amount and exit with error\n24. should compute payout 400 G for regular sword damage 500 G -- standard reimbursement minus deductible\n25. should compute payout 100 G for rune damage 200 G -- standard reimbursement minus deductible\n26. should apply 100 G deductible per damaged item -- applies once per item in damage event\n27. should cap total payout per policy at twice the insurance sum\n28. should reimburse damage to items with enchantment level ≥ 8 at 50 % of damage amount -- then apply deductible\n29. should fully reimburse damage to items made of dragon material -- then apply deductible\n30. should apply both 50 % rule and deductible for dragon-material sword with enchantment 9 -- 50 % rule wins\n31. should fully reimburse dragon-material sword with enchantment 5 -- only dragon-material clause applies\n32. should reject claim if damages array has more entries of a type than insured -- claim validation\n33. should compute premium 165 G for cursed sword by newcomer -- integration example\n34. should compute premium 160 G for cursed highly-enchanted sword by long-standing customer on second contract -- integration example, first insurance applies to new item\n35. should reduce second claim payout when cap is partially exhausted -- cap exhaustion example"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784951651285,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-b70b58f0-76ac-45b4-a51c-62bd679cb421","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}}
